"<p>...da možete pokrenuti uređivanje transakcije dvostrukim klikom na\n"
"transakciju u registru?\n"

#. i18n: file: tips:24
#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: kmymoney/tips.cpp:22
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can show more details of the selected transaction in the\n"
"register by selecting the 'ledger lens' feature in the settings dialog?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...da možete prikazati više detalja o izabranoj transakciji u\n"
"registru tako što ćete izabrati ocpiju 'uvećanje knjige' u opcijama?\n"

#. i18n: file: tips:31
#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: kmymoney/tips.cpp:28
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that transactions with no category assigned or split\n"
"transactions with unassigned values are marked with an exclamation mark \n"
"on a yellow triangle in the register?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...da transakcije bez pridruženih kategorija ili podijeljene\n"
"transakcije sa nedodijeljenim vrijednostima trepere \n"
"<font color=\"red\">crveno</font> u registru?\n"

#. i18n: file: tips:38
#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: kmymoney/tips.cpp:35
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can show all details of the transactions in the register\n"
"by typing &lt;Ctrl-T&gt; or selecting the 'Settings/Show Transaction "
"Detail'\n"
"menu entry? You can turn this feature off the same way.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...da možete prikazati sve detalje o transakciji u registru\n"
"tako što ćete tipkati &lt;Ctrl-T&gt; ili tako što ćete izabrati 'Postavke/"
"Prikaži Detalje Transakcije'\n"
"opciju u meniju? Možete isključiti ovu opciju na isti način.\n"

#. i18n: file: tips:45
#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: kmymoney/tips.cpp:42
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can switch between a listing of all accounts or\n"
"an icon view of all asset and liability accounts with the tabs\n"
"in the accounts view?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...da možete prebaciti između liste svih računa ili\n"
"pregleda ikona svih aktivnih i pasivnih računa sa karticama\n"
"u prikazu računa?\n"

#. i18n: file: tips:53
#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: kmymoney/tips.cpp:49
msgid "<p>...that the KMyMoney development team wishes you a nice day?\n"
msgstr "<p>...da vam KMyMoney razvijački tim želi ugodan dan?\n"

#. i18n: file: tips:59
#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: kmymoney/tips.cpp:54
msgid ""
"<p>...you can use your own external filter program to convert any\n"
"import format to QIF on the fly? See the QIF profile editor for\n"
"more details.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...da možete koristiti vaš eksterni filter program da konvertujete bilo "
"koji\n"
"uvozni format u QIF u letu? Pogledajte QIF uređivač profila za\n"
"više detalja.\n"

#. i18n: file: tips:67
#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: kmymoney/tips.cpp:61
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can create a scheduled transaction from an existing\n"
"one by selecting the context menu on a transaction in the ledger\n"
"or the \"More...\"-menu in the transaction form?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...da možete napraviti raspoređenu transakciju iz postojeće\n"
"odabirom kontekst menija na transakciji u knjizi\n"
"ili \"Više...\"-menijem u transakcijskoj formi?\n"

#. i18n: file: tips:75
#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: kmymoney/tips.cpp:68
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can switch to the payee of a transaction\n"
"by selecting the context menu on a transaction in the ledger\n"
"or in the transaction menu?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...da se možete prebaciti u primaoca transakcije\n"
"odabirom kontekst menija na transakciji u knjizi\n"
"ili \"Više...\"-meni u transakcijskoj formi?\n"

#. i18n: file: tips:83
#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: kmymoney/tips.cpp:75
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can modify the colors and fonts used for the ledgers\n"
"via <i>Configure/Register/...</i>?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...da možete mijenjati boje i fontove koji se koriste u poslovnim "
"knjigama\n"
"preko <i>Konfigurisanje/ Registracija /...</i>?\n"

#. i18n: file: tips:90
#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: kmymoney/tips.cpp:81
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can hide transactions prior to a specific date?\n"
"The date can be modified via <i>Configure/Register/Filter</i>.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>... da možete sakriti transakcije prije određenog datuma?\n"
"Datum može biti promijenjeno preko Konfigurisanje/Registracija/Filter</i>.\n"

#. i18n: file: tips:97
#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: kmymoney/tips.cpp:87
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can customize the \"Home-Page\"\n"
"via <i>Configure/Home</i>?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>... da možete prilagoditi \"Početnu stranicu\"npreko <i>Konfigurisanje/"
"Početna stranica</i>?\n"

#. i18n: file: tips:104
#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: kmymoney/tips.cpp:93
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can enter new transactions even while reconciling\n"
"an account? You can also make the transaction form visible.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...da možete unijeti nove transakcije čak dok se račun\n"
"usklađuje? Također možete napraviti vidljiv transakcijski obrazac.\n"

#. i18n: file: tips:111
#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: kmymoney/tips.cpp:99
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can actively support the KMyMoney development team in\n"
"cases that heavily depend on your data? You can save your data in an\n"
"anonymized way for this support.<p>\n"
"Just open your data file and immediately\n"
"select <b>File/Save as...</b>. In the <b>Save As...</b> dialog\n"
"select the filter <b>Anonymous Files</b> and make sure your file gets\n"
"the extensions <b>.anon.xml</b>. <p>\n"
"To verify, how the data looks like you are about to send away, you can open\n"
"this file in KMyMoney and see how the developers see your data.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...da možete aktivno podržati KMyMoney razvojni tim u \n"
"slučajevima koji mnogo ovise o vašim podacima? Možete spremiti vaše podatke "
"na\n"
"anoniman način za ovu podršku.<p>\n"
"Dovoljno je da otvorite podatkovnu datoteku i odmah\n"
"odaberete <b>Datoteka/Snimi kao ...</b>. U <b>Snimi kao...</b> dijalogu\n"
"odaberite filter <b>Anonimne Datoteke</b> i provjerite da li datoteka ima \n"
"nastavke <b>.anon.xml</b>. <p>\n"
"Da biste provjerili kako podaci, koje želite poslati, izgledaju, možete "
"otvoriti\n"
"ovu datoteku u KMyMoney i vidjeti kako razvojni tim vidi vaše podatke.\n"

#. i18n: file: tips:125
#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: kmymoney/tips.cpp:112
msgid ""
"<p>... that you can import your bank statements even without a network \n"
"connection? Just select the file (OFX or QIF) from the File->Import menu.</"
"p>\n"
"<p>Provided by Jose Jorge</p>\n"
msgstr ""

